  "title": "NPN transistor, 2N2222A (TO-92)",
  "summary": "General-purpose NPN transistor for switching up to 600 mA, in plastic TO-92, with its leads formed to 2.54 mm (0.1 inch) for a breadboard.",
  "tags": ["transistor", "bjt", "npn", "switch", "amplifier", "through-hole"],
